1. confirm operator alignment: action confirm_operator_alignment ?candidate ?operator_resource. Precondition: (constraint_applied ?candidate), (candidate_operator_linked ?candidate ?operator_resource), (not (operator_alignment_confirmed ?candidate)). Effect: (operator_alignment_confirmed ?candidate).

