- finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation shift_candidate_alpha (precondition: compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha, not candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha). Effect: candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha, dispatch_ready shift_candidate_alpha.

